  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This cable enables the connection between the 14500 7.4V 800mAh Li-ion Battery - PC003 and the 4 Channels Power Distribution Board (PDB) - IA005, as well as components such as the 100mm Y-Type PH2.0 to Dual SH1.0 Conversion Wire-XC003, delivering a portable, high-capacity power solution."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Consideration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The 7.4V power supply is incompatible with devices that require lower operating voltages, such as the ​Lithophane LED Backlight Board, the ​N20 Dual Shaft Worm Gear Motor (model LA009)​, and ​COB LED Strip Lights."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "​Before use, always verify the compatible voltage range listed in the product details page for your specific device.​"
    }
  ],
